## 1. What the app is

Basha Bazar helps people find rental houses ("to-lets") on foot in Bangladesh. It
records the route you walk so you can see which streets you have covered, lets you pin
to-lets you find, and lets you share what you find with other users.

**What the app is not:**

- It is **not** a property portal, broker, or estate agent.
- It does **not** own, inspect, verify, list or let any property.
- It is **not** a party to any rental agreement, payment, or negotiation between you and
  a landlord, caretaker, agent or anyone else.

Everything you see about a to-let was entered by another user, not by us.

