## 8. Walking, location and your safety

The app records your route while a walk is active and shows you streets you have
covered. Using it means walking around in public.

- **You are responsible for your own safety.** Watch traffic, people and surroundings.
- Do not use the app while driving or riding.
- Do not enter private property, restricted areas, or anywhere you are not permitted.
- Do not rely on the app for navigation, emergencies, or to judge whether an area is
  safe.
- GPS accuracy varies. Trails and pins may be wrong or incomplete.

Route recording is private to you and only runs between **Start Walk** and **Stop
Walk** — see the Privacy Policy.

